{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E0D7156D","title":"Get help from Danny","entry":"Dlg_E0D7156D::entry","exit":"Dlg_E0D7156D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_16186BE5","articyId":"72057645577636522","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Hey! How ya doin'? You look... worried? Or hungry? I can help with either. You wanna talk, or you want a toffee and ammonia strudel bun?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey! How ya doin'? You look... worried? Or hungry? I can help with either. You wanna talk, or you want a toffee and ammonia strudel bun?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":275.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32511","byteOffset":20182544,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_B5A8B2A7","articyId":"72057645577636590","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"What's on your mind?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's on your mind?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":875.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39471","byteOffset":29261984,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_AA160E3B","articyId":"72057645577636613","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Awww what!? They tried to shake you down? Hey, don't worry about it ok. I'll take care of it.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Awww what!? They tried to shake you down? Hey, don't worry about it ok. I'll take care of it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20030","byteOffset":15463088,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_DD87F708","articyId":"72057645577636629","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Sure! It's just Lomo's old bruiser squad cruising for some cream. They know you were Thad's protege. They're pushing their luck. I'll tell Lomo to reign 'em in.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure! It's just Lomo's old bruiser squad cruising for some cream. They know you were Thad's protege. They're pushing their luck. I'll tell Lomo to reign 'em in.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52103","byteOffset":34126136,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_EB9510F8","articyId":"72057645577636643","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"She cares more about her breakfast than some extra Lims. And them bruisers ain't even supposed to collect from you.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She cares more about her breakfast than some extra Lims. And them bruisers ain't even supposed to collect from you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37397","byteOffset":28486096,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_58DCE1AA","articyId":"72057645577636664","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Well, I do this favor for you today, but one day I will ask you for something and when I do... Nah, just messing with ya! I don't want nuthin'. We all gotta look out for each other, ya know?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I do this favor for you today, but one day I will ask you for something and when I do... Nah, just messing with ya! I don't want nuthin'. We all gotta look out for each other, ya know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32939","byteOffset":20346168,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_272D38C4","articyId":"72057645577636670","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Hey, any time! I see how you do business. I like it! You're good for this neighborhood. We gotta look out for each other, ya know?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, any time! I see how you do business. I like it! You're good for this neighborhood. We gotta look out for each other, ya know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19004","byteOffset":15076264,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_D5F039B7","articyId":"72057645577636686","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I believe looking to our friends for help was the correct choice.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I believe looking to our friends for help was the correct choice.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39627","byteOffset":29320840,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_7B1765D4","articyId":"72057645577636700","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Analysis of his vocal patterns suggest Mr Danetti is confident it will. And so am I.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Analysis of his vocal patterns suggest Mr Danetti is confident it will. And so am I.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50775","byteOffset":33548648,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_1DBBBC25","articyId":"72057645577636721","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"We shall, as they say, cross that bridge when we come to it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We shall, as they say, cross that bridge when we come to it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26974","byteOffset":18085264,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_C2CB75D7","articyId":"72057821671327090","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"One hundred percent. That new boss that replaced Lomo owes me for keeping the raisin poppy muffin on the menu. What's her name again? Elodie or something?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"One hundred percent. That new boss that replaced Lomo owes me for keeping the raisin poppy muffin on the menu. What's her name again? Elodie or something?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49053","byteOffset":32898056,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_698DFD1D","articyId":"72057645577636585","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I want to talk.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I want to